        "en": "Na poczcie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "At the post office: a *list* (a letter) goes in a *koperta* (an envelope) with a *znaczek* (a stamp), and a *pocztówka* is a postcard. The *listonosz* (the postman) brings letters, a *kurier* brings a *paczka* (a parcel), and a *paczkomat* is a parcel locker. *Idę na pocztę* is I'm going to the post office."
      }
    }
